  "description": "The audit log entry was recorded with format version\u202f1.0 on host **server01** under the recording identifier **rec-20230615-001**. The session belongs to user **jdoe**, who was connected via an **xterm-256color** terminal. This particular message is the first one in the stream (ID\u202f1) of audit session\u202f42, occurring at position\u202f12\u202f345\u202fms, and its event distribution spans **0.0\u20110.5\u202fs**.  \n\nThe user typed the command **ls\u202f-la**, which after scrubbing appears as the input text \u201cls -la\u201d. The raw input bytes recorded were `[108, 115, 32, 45, 108, 97]`. The terminal output that followed was:\n\n```\ntotal 0\n\ndrwxr-xr-x 2 jdoe users 4096 Jun 15 12:00 .\n```\n\nThe corresponding output bytes captured in the log are `[116, 111, 116, 97, 108, 32, 48, 10, 10, 100, 114, 119, 120, 114, 45, 120, 45, 114, 45, 120, 32, 50, 32, 106, 100, 111, 101, 32, 117, 115, 101, 114, 115, 32, 52, 48, 57, 54, 32, 74, 117, 110, 32, 49, 53, 32, 49, 50, 58, 48, 48, 10]`."
